      "URL percent decode: scratch, string, Some",
      "URL split: scratch, four strings, record, Some",
      "Two-header HTTP request: eight header objects, three strings, record, Ok",
      "Two-header HTTP response: eight header objects, two strings, record, Ok",
      "Invalid header after one constructed header: four released header objects, error string, Err"
    ]
